  Description: "Specs video player built on the SpecsNDK specs-player library: hardware-decoded playback of files and http(s) streams with a ready-made UIKit player panel (play, pause, stop, seek, loop, volume, state and media info). Falls back to a VideoTexture in the Lens Studio Preview."
